ttps://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1184/160914.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1184/160914l.jpg"}},"num_recommendations":1}],"statistics":{"status":{"watching":"17946","completed":"51470","on_hold":"1891","dropped":"3473","plan_to_watch":"23456"},"num_list_users":98236},"mal_details_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:43:24.900Z","episodes_data":[{"episode":1,"title":"Let's Go to School","aired":"2026-04-11T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/1980769544d0dd4f00_w.webp","description":"At 39, legendary hitman Juzo Ogami is stung by a mysterious wasp-like bioweapon and passes out. When he wakes up in Z.O.O.’s lab, he’s shocked to find himself in the body of a middle schooler. His next mission: infiltrate a middle school. Though reluctant at first, Ogami unexpectedly discovers the joy of learning, until a suspicious intruder storms the school."},{"episode":2,"title":"Noren Mitsuoka","aired":"2026-04-18T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19849203d439b0621c_w.webp","description":"The wasp that stung Juzo was created by Mitsuoka Pharmaceuticals, and it turns out that the daughter of the company’s president, Noren Mitsuoka, is in Juzo’s class. Beautiful, brilliant, and athletic, she`s untouchable. Hoping she may hold a clue to restoring his original body, Juzo discovers that Noren works at a ramen shop and starts forming a connection with her. But then, Noren is abducted..."},{"episode":3,"title":"Wipe Your Own Butt","aired":"2026-04-25T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/1988602301dc37c616_w.webp","description":"When Juzo falls behind in school, his classmate Ryo Shiraishi starts tutoring him. He also joins the Home Ec Club run by Ryo’s older sister, Chisato. Noren joins too, hoping it’ll help with making ramen. Then, after Mitsuoka Pharma announces that whoever marries Noren will inherit the company, a cornered Noren blurts out something completely unexpected!"},{"episode":4,"title":"The Pacifier Duel","aired":"2026-05-02T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/1992494963e2cb20f0_w.webp","description":"Juzo is still uneasy about pretending to date Noren. But then Shin Kohazame, a middle-school assassin from the Chinese underworld group Yuigan, transfers into her school to become her fiancé and claim Mitsuoka Pharmaceutical’s research and new drug. Shin challenges Noren’s “boyfriend” Juzo to a duel, and their battle begins!"},{"episode":5,"title":"There's a Unicorn up Ahead","aired":"2026-05-09T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19962503302bd95739_w.webp","description":"Juzo and the Home Ec Club bring rice balls to the baseball team, where they meet elite \"\"Unicorn\"\" Tenma Tendo. An ace in baseball, soccer, and basketball, Tenma boasts that he’ll become a “triple threat superhuman.” When he challenges Juzo to futsal simply because he’s “in the way” and mocks the Home Ec Club as a pointless play club, Juzo accepts."},{"episode":6,"title":"How About a \"Thank You\"?","aired":"2026-05-16T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19999757851d64c7b6_w.webp","description":null},{"episode":7,"title":"Doki-Doki Double Date","aired":"2026-05-23T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/20038127823e2364e0_w.webp","description":null},{"episode":8,"title":"Versus the Rindou Brothers","aired":"2026-05-30T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/20077241d56fb70b5c_w.webp","description":null},{"episode":9,"title":"The Impossible Aftermath of an Impossible Game","aired":"2026-06-06T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/201147738282a8b574_w.webp","description":null},{"episode":10,"title":"Death or Kiss","aired":"2026-06-13T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/201516370887d37d35_w.webp","description":null},{"episode":11,"title":"The First Hitman Summit","aired":"2026-06-20T23:00:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/2019